              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu busingye bwa Hezekia omugabe wa Yuda Miika owa Moresheesi akahanuura, yaagira Abayuda boona ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati:",
          "type": "text",
