        {
          "text": " Kandi hakaba hariho ondiijo mushaija owaahanwire omu iziina rya MUKAMA, owaabaire naayetwa Uria mwene Shemaaya owa Kiryasi-yearimu. Nawe akahanuura ahari oru rurembo n'ahari egi ensi ebigambo ebirikushushana n'ebya Yeremia. ",
          "type": "text",
