        },
        {
          "text": "Omugabe Yehoyakimu hamwe n'amamanzi ge goona n'abanyiginya be boona, ku baahuriire ebigambo bye, omugabe yaayenda kumweita; kwonka Uria ku yaakihuriire, yaatiina, yaacwa, yaahungira Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
